# Images

Render every image with `Image` from `next/image`. Do not use a raw `<img>`.

- Content image with a known size: set `width` and `height`.
- Full-bleed or background image: parent is `relative` or `absolute`, then `fill`, `sizes`, and `className="object-cover"`.
- Hero or other LCP image: add `preload`.
- Decorative image: `alt=""`.
- Meaningful image: a real `alt` in the page language.

```tsx
import Image from "next/image";

<Image
  src="/industria_tanques.webp"
  alt=""
  fill
  preload
  sizes="100vw"
  className="object-cover"
/>
```
